        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠺᠡᠯᠡ ᠪᠡᠨ ᠪᠢᠯᠠᠺᠥᠳᠠᠺᠥ</unicode>
          <transcript>kele ben --ky</transcript>
          <definition> To gossip maliciously.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠺᠢᠲᠤᠭ᠎ᠠ ᠪᠢᠯᠠᠺᠥᠳᠠᠺᠥ</unicode>
          <transcript>kituγ-a --ky</transcript>
          <definition> To sharpen a knife.</definition>
        </example>
      </examples>
